<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-CSFB starts Colt as &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-CSFB starts Colt as &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colt Telecom Group Plc was rated &quot;buy&quot; as analysts at CS First Boston started coverage of the company, the investment bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>CSFB analyst Evan Miller said his ten-year discounted cashflow analysis implied a fair value price of between 351p and 384p on the stock.</p>
<p>The shares were unchanged at 315p by 1055 GMT.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
